menu "JrBot V2 - hardware"
    config JR_HEADLESS_DIAGNOSTIC
        bool "Run without OLED (no I2C access to GPIO1/2)"
        default y
        help
            Keep the panel, command terminal and Wi-Fi independent of the OLED.
            No amplifier, camera, microphone or servo test runs at boot.

    config JR_AUDIO_HW04_CONFIRMED
        bool "Enable MAX98357A test on HW04 fixed pins (21/47/42)"
        default n
        help
            HW04 fixed map: BCLK=GPIO21, WS/LRC=GPIO47 and ESP32 DOUT=GPIO42
            to MAX98357A DIN. The MS3625 microphone shares GPIO21/47 clocks
            and reserves GPIO41 for its SD output. This option enables only
            the on-demand speaker test; microphone RX is not implemented yet.

    config JR_CAMERA_PINS_CONFIRMED
        bool "Allow one-shot OV5640 camera test on the existing connector"
        default n
        help
            Camera model confirmed by the owner: OV5640. The existing camera
            pin map remains unchanged. No autofocus or servo movement is run
            by camera_test; it captures one QVGA/JPEG frame and cleans up.
endmenu
